APPENDIX: DETAILED ASSUMPTIONS & CALCULATIONS



Revenue Growth Assumptions:
• Month 1-6: $400K-550K (customer acquisition phase)
• Month 7-18: $600K-2.5M (product-market fit scaling)
• Month 19+: $3.2M+ (enterprise customer momentum)
